  <p id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBB">寂</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBB">子玄</persName>，性迅動，好文章。讀<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:m0014" ref="ztt_dg1_nzz">范滂</persName>傳，未嘗不歎悒。<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:m0024" ref="euq_wt7_i8i">王融</persName>敗後，<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:u0029" type="unresolved">賓客</rs>多歸之。齊建武初，欲獻中興頌，兄<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:m0047" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC">志</persName>謂曰：「汝膏粱年少，何患不達？不鎮之以靜，將恐貽譏。」<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangji-digital:p001:m0075" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBB">寂</persName>乃止。位秘書郎。卒年二十一。</p>
</text>
